            <history xml:id="history_idfb462bcd">
               <p xml:id="idm125">The two little pieces were written for Gade's sister-in-law during a summer holiday in Hobro. They were based on sketches from Gade's visit to Amalfi and Palermo in 1844 meant for his teacher A.P. Berggreen, who was editing a collection of folk songs.</p>
            </history>
